186:{"name":"SiteMarkdownContent","key":null,"env":"Server","owner":"$2b","stack":[["rendere","/app/apps/web/.next/dev/server/chunks/ssr/[root-of-the-server]__1n3w8thybi_rt._.js",1274,263,1272,1,false],["renderLocalizedMarkdown","/app/apps/web/.next/dev/server/chunks/ssr/[root-of-the-server]__1n3w8thybi_rt._.js",1288,24,1284,1,false],["","/app/apps/web/.next/dev/server/chunks/ssr/[root-of-the-server]__1n3w8thybi_rt._.js",1308,232,1301,32,false],["Array.map","",0,0,0,0,false],["renderCmsMarkdown","/app/apps/web/.next/dev/server/chunks/ssr/[root-of-the-server]__1n3w8thybi_rt._.js",1301,28,1295,1,false],["CmsCatchAllPage","/app/apps/web/.next/dev/server/chunks/ssr/[root-of-the-server]__0s8yetrxx9fn5._.js",216,221,195,1,false]],"props":{"content":"## Quality as the basis for reliable decisions\n\nBy combining data, analysis and benchmarking, material quality becomes a reliable decision-making foundation.\n\nThis reduces risks in:\n\n- sourcing\n- processing\n- application\n\n### Quality as part of sourcing and feedstock management\n\nAt plastship, material quality is integrated into:\n\n- sourcing & distribution\n- waste management & closed loops\n- traceability & compliance\n\n### What this means in practice:\n\n- only qualified materials enter the market\n- quality requirements are reproducible\n- data remains consistent across the supply chain","eagerFirstImage":false,"pageHeading":false,"remarkPlugins":"$undefined"}}
187:{"time":145.42041699960828}
188:{"name":"Markdown","key":null,"env":"Server","owner":"$186","stack":[["SiteMarkdownContent","/app/apps/web/.next/dev/server/chunks/ssr/[root-of-the-server]__1n3w8thybi_rt._.js",248,263,247,1,false]],"props":{"components":"$151:props:components","urlTransform":"$153","remarkPlugins":"$undefined","rehypePlugins":[["$154",{"pageHeadingLine":null}],["$155",{"eagerFirst":false}],["$156",{"content":"## Quality as the basis for reliable decisions\n\nBy combining data, analysis and benchmarking, material quality becomes a reliable decision-making foundation.\n\nThis reduces risks in:\n\n- sourcing\n- processing\n- application\n\n### Quality as part of sourcing and feedstock management\n\nAt plastship, material quality is integrated into:\n\n- sourcing & distribution\n- waste management & closed loops\n- traceability & compliance\n\n### What this means in practice:\n\n- only qualified materials enter the market\n- quality requirements are reproducible\n- data remains consistent across the supply chain","fallback":"$undefined"}],"$157","$158"],"children":"## Quality as the basis for reliable decisions\n\nBy combining data, analysis and benchmarking, material quality becomes a reliable decision-making foundation.\n\nThis reduces risks in:\n\n- sourcing\n- processing\n- application\n\n### Quality as part of sourcing and feedstock management\n\nAt plastship, material quality is integrated into:\n\n- sourcing & distribution\n- waste management & closed loops\n- traceability & compliance\n\n### What this means in practice:\n\n- only qualified materials enter the market\n- quality requirements are reproducible\n- data remains consistent across the supply chain"}}
